:1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"分子ガストロノミー","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%AD%90%E3%82%AC%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%83%8E%E3%83%9F%E3%83%BC","text":"分子ガストロノミー（ぶんしガストロノミー、英: molecular gastronomy）とは、調理を物理的、化学的に解析した科学的学問分野である。分子美食学と訳されることもある。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Raw_egg.jpg/1200px-Raw_egg.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%AD%90%E3%82%AC%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%83%8E%E3%83%9F%E3%83%BC","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%88%86%E5%AD%90%E3%82%AC%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%83%8E%E3%83%9F%E3%83%BC"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mudBf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e12a2796-f63b-4f1a-962d-e6fecc9cc1dd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"食戟のソーマで薙切アリスがやってたやつかね","ts":"1618019018.180000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GMXXM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc14f116-8cbe-4002-a4f9-48fe2176d13e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"目次熟読してるけどこれめっちゃ好きなタイプのやつだ","ts":"1618018714.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xsFeO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abb932d8-d432-4ec4-909e-bd30c88b6a19","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおー、これは期待","ts":"1618018678.178900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wx8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3f95021-3dbd-4df4-9e99-19cab0709393","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"わけわからんw","ts":"1618016871.178500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FYPX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b06acabe-3e10-43bb-bb99-b442ec0edb3c","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"この新刊のサマリからただならぬ雰囲気を感じてます...\n「温めると固まり、冷やすと溶けるけんちん汁」ってどんなんだろう。\n\u003chttps://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119489/\u003e","ts":"1618016560.178200","attachments":[{"fallback":"分子調理の日本食","id":1,"title":"分子調理の日本食","title_link":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119489/","text":"新たな調理方法と料理を分子レベルから開発する「分子調理法」を、身近な日本食に応用した世界で初めての書籍です。「ゲル化」「熱ゲル化」「泡化、炭酸化」「架橋化」「乳化」「実験器具利用化」といった技術を使って作り出したレシピと、その背景にある「分子調理学」の解説が掲載されています。紹介する料理は、きれいなスノードームに入ったふろふき大根、温めると固まって冷やすと溶けるけんちん汁、アサリと三つ葉が美しいお吸い物球体、甘辛いイナゴのハンバーグ、かつお節でできた酒器、液体窒素で冷やした冷やし中華、“脳天に突き刺さる”ほどのうま味が濃縮した煮汁ソースなど。読むと未来の料理を空想してしまいたくなるような一冊です。英文併記。","thumb_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/images/picture_large978-4-87311-948-9.jpeg","blocks":null,"service_name":"oreilly.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":516,"thumb_height":660,"from_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119489/","original_url":"https://www.oreilly.co.jp/books/9784873119489/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yG0b0"}]}]
